<title>UK: Airtours appoints new president of Sunquest.</title>
<headline>Airtours appoints new president of Sunquest.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK tour operator Airtours Plc said on Monday that it has appointed Michael Stone as president of its tour operating subsidiary company, Sunquest Holdings.</p>
<p>Stone will oversee the development of Airtour Group's operations in the U.S. and will report to Leo Desrochers, CEO of North American Leisure Group.</p>
<p>Sunquest Holidays forms part of a group called the North American Leisure Group.</p>
<p>Stone was most recently president and CEO of Certified Vacations, a large U.S. travel wholesaler.</p>
<p>- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
